      "content": "thanks. can you actually write the draft for me? i want it to sound really strong—like, it shouldn't just be \"asking\" for a review, it should argue that it's actually a fundamental right for parents to control this stuff and that the school overstepping is really undermining the family unit. make it sound like a serious warning.",
